[{:adr/authoritative_for ["kotoba-lang/x402-directory = 汎用 HTML directory-page renderer for any\n    x402-compliant facilitator's GET /catalog response。gftdcojp/nexus-x402 の\n    nexus.directory を branding パラメータ化して抽出した public/Apache-2.0 lib" "抽出パターンは kotoba-lang/pay・kotoba-lang/treasury と同型 (実装の一実例を\n    汎用ライブラリへ切り出し、既存プロダクトへ逆依存させる)。never-fabricates\n    不変条件 (空 registry は honest empty state) をテストで固定"], :adr/supersedes [], :adr/superseded_by [], :adr/topic "kotoba-lang-x402-directory-extraction", :adr/related ["adr-2607093300-nexus-x402-facilitator-gateway"], :adr/status "accepted", :adr/id "adr-2607110600-kotoba-lang-x402-directory-extraction", :adr/addendum-2026-07-10-followups-and-llm-friendly-design "{:followups-landed [\"nexus-x402 src/nexus/directory.cljc now depends on kotoba-lang/x402-directory (vendored src/x402/directory.cljc) instead of duplicating it — same tests pass, behavior unchanged\" \"orgs/kotoba-lang/x402-directory west-registered (--entry x402-directory, pin == repo HEAD verified)\"], :llm-friendly-design-pass {:trigger \"owner instruction: polish the LP, and specifically design it to be easy for an LLM to use\", :page-branding-extension [\":page-title\" \":meta-description\" \":badge-label\" \":nav-links\" \":extra-sections-html\"], :new-fn \"x402.directory/llms-txt — plain-markdown summary of the same live /catalog data per the llms.txt convention (https://llmstxt.org)\", :nexus-wiring [\"GET /llms.txt (content-negotiated alongside the existing HTML page)\" \"GET /stats — aggregate-only settlement census {count usd-total agent-hint:{agent human unknown}}, no per-payment payer/tx/timestamp, no auth needed\"], :new-settlements-fns [\"nexus.settlements/classify-user-agent\" \"nexus.settlements/agent-hint-breakdown\"], :invariant-preserved \"never-fabricates — /stats and llms.txt report only what /catalog and the real settlement ledger already contain\"}}", :adr/doc_type "adr", :adr/last_verified "2026-07-10", :adr/body "# ADR-2607110600\n\n**Status**: accepted **Date**: 2026-07-10\n\n## Decision\n\nkotoba-lang/x402-directory (public, Apache-2.0) を新規作成。nexus.directory\n(nexus-x402 の live directory page, ADR-0002 GTM step3) を branding\nパラメータ化して抽出: x402.directory/page が {:origin :items :branding} を\n受け取り :branding をデフォルトにマージ。8 tests/21 assertions, clj-kondo\nclean。never-fabricates 不変条件をテストで固定。kotoba-lang/pay・treasury と\n同型の抽出パターン (README に x402.nexus を dogfood live demo として明記)。\nfollow-up: nexus-x402 側を本 lib への依存に切り替え (別 commit)。manifest\n登録は --entry x402-directory の最小 diff。\n\n## Consequences\n\n(+) HN/Reddit/Base コンテンツが実在する動く OSS 成果物を指せる。(+) 他\nfacilitator 運用者が directory UI をゼロから書かずに済む。(−) nexus-x402 側\n切り替えまでは一時的な重複。(−) CI ワークフロー雛形は follow-up。", :adr/deciders ["Jun Kawasaki"], :adr/date "2026-07-10", :db/id -1, :adr/authoritative true, :adr/title "ADR-2607110600: kotoba-lang/x402-directory — nexus-x402 の HTML ディレクトリ page を汎用 lib へ抽出", :adr/source-format "edn"}]